ffmpeg-rockchip (8.0.3-1+rkmpp.20260423.6404384) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Link libav* statically so this package ships no shared library and cannot
    shadow the distribution's libavcodec.
  * Install the tools as ffmpeg-rockchip and ffprobe-rockchip, with symlinks
    in /usr/local/bin created on install and removed on removal.

